                <pb facs="0787" n="693" xml:id="pg693"/>

                <head>No. 435.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Manning to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-03-08"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 8, 1887</date>.
                        (Received March 9.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Assurance has been given me by Mr. Mariscal that directions have been issued by
                    the Government of Mexico for the instant return to the American authorities of
                    the persons taken from their custody by the Mexicans, and that those who
                    effected the rescue shall be punished.</p>
            </div>
